Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 10:28:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] ipa: simple: Add software ISP sharpness control

Expose the standard Sharpness control from the simple IPA and make its default tunable per sensor. Apply a restrained five-tap unsharp mask in both EGL and CPU software ISP backends so scaled captures retain local detail without forcing extra contrast into the tone curve.

Signed-off-by: Lolren <loren.bufanu@gmail.com>
